# ============================================================================
# Authentication Configuration
# ============================================================================
#
# Default: Azure CLI. Run `az login` (same tenant as Fabric). No values needed.
#
# Service principal: uncomment all three. DuckDB and REST both use this identity.
#
# FABRIC_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
# FABRIC_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
# FABRIC_TENANT_ID=your_tenant_id_here
